"smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　資本組入額　1,016.60円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　割当先　　　野村證券株式会社&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;４．新株予約権の行使による増加であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;５．普通株式１株につき4株の株式分割によるものであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;６．&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;譲渡制限付株式報酬としての新株式発行によるものであります。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　発行価格　　　