  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsNotBasedOnResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingOrBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(3) 【株主総会決議又は取締役会決議に基づかないものの内容】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsNotBasedOnResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingOrBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:DisposalsOrHoldingOfAcquiredTreasurySharesTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(4) 【取得自己株式の処理状況及び保有状況】&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:7pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:471.8pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
